leios.theme.fastfetch-theme (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install the default configuration as /etc/fastfetch/config.jsonc, the
    lowest-priority location fastfetch reads, so configs in
    ~/.config/fastfetch/ or /etc/xdg/fastfetch/ override it. fastfetch never
    read the previous location, /usr/share/fastfetch/config.jsonc.
  * Draw the LeiOS logo as ASCII art in the usual fastfetch style and size
    (16 lines), in the logo's colours.

 -- Linus Fischer <leicraft@leicraftmc.de>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100

leios.theme.fastfetch-theme (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.

